# RetailIQ — authoritative build plan

Specification version: 1.0 • Prepared: 17 October 2026 • Stage: specification only.

## Product decision

RetailIQ connects shopping needs, verified product facts, available stock, fulfillment choices, demand signals and approved operational actions. Its central demonstration is **a customer need becoming an evidence-backed business decision, with the subsequent outcome traceable to the original need**.

Keep RetailIQ as the platform name. Use “Recover the purchase. Learn what to stock next.” as the demo narrative. UNLOST describes the purchase-recovery journey; it is not a second application or a replacement brand. Strategic alternatives and competition facts are in [01_COMPETITION_AND_PRODUCT_STRATEGY.md](01_COMPETITION_AND_PRODUCT_STRATEGY.md).

